 shares the same shape as the Sub-Process, which is a rectangle that has rounded corners.", "@language": "en"}}, "evidence_type": "deterministic", "references": [{"source_uri": "file:ontology/bbo.ttl#sha256=06c245c7c69098b2a28c9a59c97ea1f1e157d41a22f0f0e10f172d185a4cf9af"}]}, {"op": "add_claim", "subject": "https://www.irit.fr/recherches/MELODI/ontologies/BBO#Task", "predicate": "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy", "object": {"entity": "https://www.irit.fr/recherches/MELODI/ontologies/BBO"}, "evidence_type": "deterministic", "references": [{"source_uri": "file:ontology/bbo.ttl#sha256=06c245c7c69098b2a28c9a59c97ea1f1e157d41a22f0f0e10f172d185a4cf9af"}]}, {"op": "add_claim", "subject": "https://www.irit.fr/recherches/MELODI/ontologies/BBO#Task", "predicate": "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label", "object": {"value": {"@value": "Task", "@language": "en"}}, "evidence_type": "deterministic", "references": [{"source_uri": "file:ontology/bbo.ttl#sha256=06c245c7c69098b2a28c9a59c97ea1f1e157d41a22f0f0e10f172d185a4cf9af"}]}, {"op": "add_claim", "subject": "https://www.irit.fr/recherches/MELODI/ontologies/BBO#Task", "predicate": "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf", "object": {"entity": "https://www.irit.fr/recherches/MELODI/ontologies/BBO#Activity"}, "evidence_type": "deterministic", "references": [{"source_uri": "file:ontology/bbo.ttl#sha256=06c245c7c69098b2a28c9a59c97ea1f1e157d41a22f0f0e10f172d185a4cf9af"}]}, {"op": "add_claim", "subject": "https://www.irit.fr/recherches/MELODI/ontologies/BBO#ThrowEvent", "predicate": "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "object": {"entity": "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"}, "evidence_type": "deterministic", "references": [{"source_uri": "file:ontology/bbo.ttl#sha256=06c245c7c69098b2a28c9a59c97ea1f1e157d41a22f0f0e10f172d185a4cf9af"}]}, {"op": "add_claim", "subject": "https://www.irit.fr/recherches/MELODI/ontologies/BBO#ThrowEvent", "predicate": "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "object": {"value": {"@value": "Events that throw a Result. All End Events and some Intermediate Events are throwing Events that MAY eventually be caught by another Event. Typically the trigger carries information out of the scope where the throw Event occurred into the scope of the catching Events. The throwing of a trigger MAY be either implicit as defined by this standard or an extension to it or explicit by a throw Event", "@language": "en"}}, "evidence_type": "deterministic", "references": [{"source_uri": "file:ontology/bbo.ttl#sha256=06c245c7c69098b2a28c9a59c97ea1f1e157d41a22f0f0e10f172d185a4cf9af"}]}, {"op": "add_claim", "subject": "https://www.irit.fr/recherches/MELODI/ontologies/BBO#ThrowEvent", "predicate": "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy", "object": {"entity": "https://www.irit.fr/recherches/MELODI/ontologies/BBO"}, "evidence_type": "deterministic", "references": [{"source_uri": "file:ontology/bbo.ttl#sha256=06c245c7c69098b2a28c9a59c97ea1f1e157d41a22f0f0e10f172d185a4cf9af"}]}, {"op": "add_claim", "subject": "https://www.irit.fr/recherches/MELODI/ontologies/BBO#ThrowEvent", "predicate": "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label", "object": {"value": {"@value": "ThrowEvent", "@language": "en"}}, "evidence_type": "deterministic", "references": [{"source_uri": "file:ontology/bbo.ttl#sha256=06c245c7c69098b2a28c9a59c97ea1f1e157d41a22f0f0e10f172d185a4cf9af"}]}, {"op": "add_claim", "subject": "https://www.irit.fr/recherches/MELODI/ontologies/BBO#ThrowEvent", "predicate": "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf", "object": {"entity": "https://www.irit.fr/recherches/MELODI/ontologies/BBO#Event"}, "evidence_type": "deterministic", "references": [{"source_uri": "file:ontology/bbo.ttl#sha256=06c245c7c69098b2a28c9a59c97ea1f1e157d41a22f0f0e10f172d185a4cf9af"}]}, {"op": "add_claim", "subject": "https://www.irit.fr/recherches/MELODI/ontologies/BBO#UserTask", "predicate": "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "object": {"entity